#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-overview.rst:5 604454e7c0af4d66b973d11f4d948399
msgid "QuadPlane Overview"
msgstr "QuadPlane 概述"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-overview.rst:10
#: 1241aaeadd1a4bb78f43a8c448293a39
msgid ""
"A QuadPlane is a combined fixed wing and MultiCopter aircraft. This sort of "
"aircraft brings the benefit of vertical takeoff and landing, significantly "
"greater speed and range of travel, and the ability to hover and perform "
"copter-like tasks at the destination."
msgstr ""
"QuadPlane "
"是一种集固定翼和多旋翼飞行器于一体的混合飞机。这类飞机兼具垂直起降的优势、显著更长的航程和飞行速度，以及在目的地悬停并执行类似多旋翼任务的能力。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-overview.rst:15
#: df415cd3d5444e1ebcd7c47a669c19ef
msgid ""
"QuadPlane is built upon Plane, but adds copter like stability control for "
"one or more motors. In some configurations 4 or more additional motors are "
"added . Additional modes and commands allow a QuadPlane to take off, land "
"and fly like a copter, and to smoothly transition between the Plane and "
"Copter-like (VTOL) modes in both automatic and autopilot-assisted modes. The"
" additional rotors can also provide lift and stability in normal Plane "
"modes."
msgstr ""
"QuadPlane 基于 Plane 构建，但为一个或多个电机添加了类似多旋翼的稳定控制。在某些构型中会额外增加4个或更多电机。额外的模式和命令使 "
"QuadPlane 能够像多旋翼一样起飞、降落和飞行，并在自动和飞控辅助模式下平滑切换 Plane 和多旋翼（VTOL）模式。额外的旋翼还可以在普通 "
"Plane 模式下提供升力和稳定性。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-overview.rst:21
#: 662a005d43fb4ca087228aa99ca79b16
msgid "Types and Configurations"
msgstr "类型与构型"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-overview.rst:23
#: 0b69d5b4e01e4505a29ebc7b0228b425
msgid ""
"The image below illustrates the wide variety of configurations that are "
"possible. Motors can be under tilt control or not, the number of motors can "
"vary from one to 8 or more, and the VTOL stance of the QuadPlane can either "
"be horizontal, like a plane in normal fixed wing flight, or vertical (called"
" Tailsitters)."
msgstr ""
"下图展示了多种可能的构型。电机可以受倾转控制或不受控，电机数量可从1个到8个或更多，QuadPlane 的 VTOL "
"姿态可以是水平的（如普通固定翼飞行），也可以是垂直的（称为尾坐式）。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-overview.rst:30
#: 2448e6dfb1d74b0da1a15d3edaf424bd
msgid "Installing the Firmware"
msgstr "安装固件"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-overview.rst:32
#: a096a8fe8de3477db5dcd92e9e7ebe15
msgid ""
"The normal instructions for installing the Plane firmware apply since "
"QuadPlane functions are an option within the Plane firmware."
msgstr "安装 Plane 固件的常规说明同样适用，因为 QuadPlane 功能是 Plane 固件中的一个选项。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-overview.rst:34
#: a48ddc03d8ac41278207bc10f4160eb7
msgid ""
"When you install the plane firmware and look in the parameter list you will "
"see a :ref:`Q_ENABLE<Q_ENABLE>` parameter. That defaults to zero, which "
"disables QuadPlane support. Setting :ref:`Q_ENABLE<Q_ENABLE>` to 1 will "
"enable QuadPlane support. You then need to refresh your parameter list to "
"see all the other QuadPlane options. All QuadPlane specific parameters start"
" with \\Q_."
msgstr ""
"当您安装固定翼固件并查看参数列表时，您将看到 :ref:`Q_ENABLE<Q_ENABLE>` 参数。该参数默认为零，即禁用四旋翼飞机支持。将 "
":ref:`Q_ENABLE<Q_ENABLE>` 设置为 1 "
"将启用四旋翼飞机支持。然后您需要刷新参数列表以查看所有其他四旋翼飞机选项。所有四旋翼飞机专用参数均以 \\Q_ 开头。"
